 538.42, "end": 539.58, "text": "Ow! - Oh my God!"}, {"start": 539.58, "end": 540.42, "text": "Are you okay?"}, {"start": 540.42, "end": 541.26, "text": "- Barely felt it."}, {"start": 541.26, "end": 542.38, "text": "- Well, let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 542.38, "end": 543.62, "text": "- British in the bathroom."}, {"start": 543.62, "end": 544.62, "text": "- Oh, um."}, {"start": 548.06, "end": 549.42, "text": "- Oh no, what happened?"}, {"start": 549.42, "end": 550.52, "text": "- A minor head wound."}, {"start": 550.52, "end": 551.36, "text": "If there's an abrasion,"}, {"start": 551.36, "end": 553.02, "text": "we'll clean it with iodine and apply ice."}, {"start": 553.02, "end": 554.42, "text": "- You make a good nurse."}, {"start": 554.42, "end": 555.24, "text": "- Thanks."}, {"start": 555.24, "end": 557.38, "text": "- Dr. Shirley says mini pies are the best medicine."}, {"start": 557.38, "end": 560.08, "text": "- Then I'd like to see her degree."}, {"start": 560.08, "end": 562.74, "text": "- He's budding antlers with you because you're a threat now."}, {"start": 562.74, "end": 565.38, "text": "You got your own place, you've got a future,"}, {"start": 565.38, "end": 569.12, "text": "you've got a bowl full of olives next to the toilet."}, {"start": 569.12, "end": 571.02, "text": "- It's a fancy party, Britta."}, {"start": 571.02, "end": 573.66, "text": "- You know what Jeff has in his bathroom?"}, {"start": 573.66, "end": 575.1, "text": "Neither do I."}, {"start": 575.1, "end": 578.6, "text": "He keeps his toiletries in a safe under the sink."}, {"start": 578.6, "end": 581.94, "text": "His whole personality is based around guarding himself."}, {"start": 581.94, "end": 583.94, "text": "You don't have to be like that to be a man."}, {"start": 586.58, "end": 587.58, "text": "You're really cool, Berta."}, {"start": 589.08, "end": 591.88, "text": "Man! Pizza guys are getting worse and worse looking."}, {"start": 591.88, "end": 593.88, "text": "I guess all the good ones went into porn."}, {"start": 593.88, "end": 595.38, "text": "Ceiling fan."}, {"start": 595.38, "end": 596.88, "text": "I miss all the fun."}, {"start": 596.88, "end": 598.38, "text": "I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 598.38, "end": 599.38, "text": "Who cares?"}, {"start": 599.38, "end": 600.38, "text": "Who cares?"}, {"start": 603.38, "end": 604.38, "text": "[laughs]"}, {"start": 604.38, "end": 606.38, "text": "[buzzer]"}, {"start": 606.38, "end": 607.88, "text": "Ah, okay."}, {"start": 607.88, "end": 609.88, "text": "Starting on my left with one,"}, {"start": 609.88, "end": 610.88, "text": "your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 610.88, "end": 612.88, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you were not creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 612.88, "end": 614.88, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 618.88, "end": 621.88, "text": "Six. One, two, three, four, five, six. Brita."}, {"start": 621.88, "end": 622.88, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 622.88, "end": 625.88, "text": "Great. You know what's great? Air travel."}, {"start": 625.88, "end": 628.88, "text": "I've flown a lot. A lot of airplane stories."}, {"start": 628.88, "end": 629.88, "text": "I once had sex with Eartha Kitt."}, {"start": 629.88, "end": 631.88, "text": "Okay. I'm gonna check on my pies."}, {"start": 638.88, "end": 639.88, "text": "You guys are my best."}, {"start": 639.88, "end": 640.88, "text": "I'm gonna get a drink."}, {"start": 640.88, "end": 641.88, "text": "Ow!"}, {"start": 641.88, "end": 642.88, "text": "Oh my God!"}, {"start": 642.88, "end": 643.88, "text": "Are you okay?"}, {"start": 643.88, "end": 644.88, "text": "Barely felt it."}, {"start": 644.88, "end": 646.88, "text": "Let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 648.88, "end": 650.88, "text": "Did I need some refill of the toilet olives?"}, {"start": 650.88, "end": 651.88, "text": "We're good. I checked."}, {"start": 651.88, "end": 652.88, "text": "You're the best."}, {"start": 652.88, "end": 653.88, "text": "Wanna stay up all night talking to our bunk beds?"}, {"start": 653.88, "end": 654.88, "text": "Do-do-y."}, {"start": 654.88, "end": 655.88, "text": "Here, Troy."}, {"start": 655.88, "end": 657.88, "text": "Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 657.88, "end": 658.88, "text": "Oh, cool."}, {"start": 658.88, "end": 660.88, "text": "Thanks, Pierce."}, {"start": 660.88, "end": 662.88, "text": "You make a good nurse, Annie."}, {"start": 662.88, "end": 663.88, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 663.88, "end": 666.88, "text": "I actually had to apply a tourniquet the other day."}, {"start": 666.88, "end": 668.88, "text": "Like I got stabbed outside my building."}, {"start": 668.88, "end": 669.88, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 669.88, "end": 671.88, "text": "Annie, you gotta get the hell out of that apartment."}, {"start": 671.88, "end": 674.88, "text": "- You don't have to treat me like a kid anymore, remember?"}, {"start": 674.88, "end": 677.88, "text": "- Yeah, but adults still need to be protected."}, {"start": 677.88, "end": 680.88, "text": "I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 680.88, "end": 682.88, "text": "You important to me."}, {"start": 685.88, "end": 686.88, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 686.88, "end": 687.88, "text": "Fear the terror!"}, {"start": 687.88, "end": 688.88, "text": "Fear the terror, Troy!"}, {"start": 688.88, "end": 691.88, "text": "Fear the terror, Norwegian Troy!"}, {"start": 691.88, "end": 693.88, "text": "- What's going on in here?"}, {"start": 693.88, "end": 694.88, "text": "- Here's to terrorizing Troy because he's jealous"}, {"start": 694.88, "end": 696.44, "text": "- Here's to terrorizing Troy because he's jealous"}, {"start": 696.44, "end": 697.28, "text": "we moved in together."}, {"start": 697.28, "end": 698.36, "text": "- You're the one who's jealous."}, {"start": 698.36, "end": 699.2, "text": "- Why would I be jealous?"}, {"start": 699.2, "end": 701.5, "text": "- Because you're lonely and crazy."}, {"start": 707.24, "end": 710.52, "text": "- Hey guys, this is Toby, our pizza delivery guy,"}, {"start": 710.52, "end": 712.38, "text": "and I know this is gonna sound nuts,"}, {"start": 712.38, "end": 715.1, "text": "but we're in love and we're getting married."}, {"start": 722.44, "end": 724.38, "text": "- I wonder what happened on all those other timelines."}, {"start": 724.38, "end": 727.66, "text": "Wait, there are other timelines?"}, {"start": 727.66, "end": 729.54, "text": "(buzzer)"}, {"start": 729.54, "end": 730.66, "text": "- Ah, okay."}, {"start": 730.66, "end": 732.5, "text": "Starting on my left with one,"}, {"start": 732.5, "end": 733.9, "text": "your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 733.9, "end": 734.74, "text": "- Just so you know, Jeff,"}, {"start": 734.74, "end": 736.02, "text": "you were not creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 736.02, "end": 737.42, "text": "- Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 742.02, "end": 743.48, "text": "One, Troy."}, {"start": 743.48, "end": 745.26, "text": "- Damn it, I'm gonna go as fast as I can"}, {"start": 745.26, "end": 746.5, "text": "so I don't miss anything."}, {"start": 750.54, "end": 752.46, "text": "- You know who I used to call Miss Anything?"}, {"start": 752.46, "end": 753.3, "text": "Eartha Kitt."}, {"start": 753.3, "end": 756.1, "text": "- Oh, my God. - He totally set that up."}, {"start": 756.18, "end": 758.48, "text": "I'm checking on my pies."}, {"start": 758.56, "end": 760.9, "text": "- Russ! - No."}, {"start": 760.98, "end": 763.9, "text": "- Bathroom? - Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 763.98, "end": 767.24, "text": "Jeff, tell us about your father. I'm gonna get a drink."}, {"start": 767.32, "end": 770.08, "text": "- Oh, my God. Are you okay? - I barely felt it."}, {"start": 770.16, "end": 772.28, "text": "Let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 780.0, "end": 782.0, "text": "What the hell?"}, {"start": 783.3, "end": 786.14, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 786.14, "end": 787.44, "text": "- Call 911!"}, {"start": 787.44, "end": 789.44, "text": "Ormond, help me stop the bleeding!"}, {"start": 789.44, "end": 792.14, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 792.14, "end": 793.14, "text": "- I'm dying!"}, {"start": 793.14, "end": 794.06, "text": "I am dying!"}, {"start": 795.78, "end": 796.62, "text": "- Rock!"}, {"start": 797.62, "end": 799.22, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 799.22, "end": 800.06, "text": "- Water."}, {"start": 800.06, "end": 800.9, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 800.9, "end": 801.86, "text": "- Water!"}, {"start": 801.86, "end": 802.7, "text": "- Water!"}, {"start": 802.7, "end": 803.52, "text": "- Water!"}, {"start": 803.52, "end": 805.86, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 812.7, "end": 814.7, "text": "[all screaming]"}, {"start": 814.7, "end": 816.7, "text": "[all screaming]"}, {"start": 816.7, "end": 818.7, "text": "[all screaming]"}, {"start": 818.7, "end": 820.7, "text": "[buzzer]"}, {"start": 820.7, "end": 822.7, "text": "Ugh, okay."}, {"start": 822.7, "end": 825.7, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 825.7, "end": 827.7, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you were not creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 827.7, "end": 829.7, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 835.7, "end": 838.7, "text": "Five. One, two, three, four, five."}, {"start": 838.7, "end": 839.7, "text": "-Abed. -I'm on it."}, {"start": 839.7, "end": 843.14, "text": "You know who else was on it, and you know what it is."}, {"start": 843.14, "end": 844.9, "text": "- Everybody give me money."}, {"start": 844.9, "end": 848.32, "text": "- Well, that ass got really soft into personality."}, {"start": 849.22, "end": 850.52, "text": "- I banged her at the kid."}, {"start": 852.06, "end": 853.06, "text": "- Russ! - No!"}, {"start": 855.02, "end": 855.86, "text": "- Bathroom?"}, {"start": 855.86, "end": 856.7, "text": "- Down the hall."}, {"start": 860.66, "end": 862.18, "text": "I'm getting a drink."}, {"start": 862.18, "end": 863.02, "text": "(thud)"}, {"start": 863.02, "end": 863.86, "text": "- Ow!"}, {"start": 863.86, "end": 864.7, "text": "- Oh my God, are you okay?"}, {"start": 864.7, "end": 865.52, "text": "- I barely felt it."}, {"start": 865.52, "end": 866.42, "text": "- Well, let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 866.42, "end": 867.38, "text": "- Britta's in the bathroom."}, {"start": 867.38, "end": 868.22, "text": "- Oh."}, {"start": 869.7, "end": 871.7, "text": "Oh, no, what happened?"}, {"start": 871.7, "end": 873.7, "text": "Minor head wound."}, {"start": 873.7, "end": 875.7, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 875.7, "end": 877.7, "text": "What smells amazing?"}, {"start": 877.7, "end": 879.7, "text": "Oh, someone wants pie!"}, {"start": 879.7, "end": 881.7, "text": "You ain't a good nurse."}, {"start": 881.7, "end": 883.7, "text": "[giggling]"}, {"start": 883.7, "end": 885.7, "text": "[sighs]"}, {"start": 885.7, "end": 887.7, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 887.7, "end": 889.7, "text": "They taste just like regular-sized pies."}, {"start": 889.7, "end": 891.7, "text": "Oh, yay!"}, {"start": 891.7, "end": 893.7, "text": "Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 893.7, "end": 895.7, "text": "Oh, whew. Thanks, Pierce."}, {"start": 895.7, "end": 897.7, "text": "Hey, while we're alone,"}, {"start": 897.7, "end": 899.7, "text": "I just want to say thanks for letting me live with you."}, {"start": 899.7, "end": 903.7, "text": "Sometimes I feel like making desserts is the only thing I'm good for in the group."}, {"start": 903.7, "end": 906.7, "text": "But now it's time for me to try and make it on my own."}, {"start": 906.7, "end": 908.7, "text": "Just like you did."}, {"start": 908.7, "end": 910.7, "text": "I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 910.7, "end": 913.7, "text": "- I don't think you should open it. - No, what? What are you talking about?"}, {"start": 913.7, "end": 915.7, "text": "You're very important to me."}, {"start": 915.7, "end": 918.7, "text": "Crap. I was not supposed to eat your stuff. We all made an agreement."}, {"start": 918.7, "end": 921.7, "text": "Crap. I was not supposed to say that out loud."}, {"start": 921.7, "end": 924.7, "text": "Crap! Okay, cards on the table. I'm really high right now."}, {"start": 924.7, "end": 926.7, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 926.7, "end": 928.2, "text": "- Seriously, I-- - Can you stop and give me--"}, {"start": 928.2, "end": 929.7, "text": "No, I wanna give you something else."}, {"start": 929.7, "end": 932.5, "text": "A water pick. A speedboat. Two water picks."}, {"start": 932.5, "end": 935.5, "text": "I can't believe I'm feeding my pies to a drug addict."}, {"start": 935.5, "end": 937.8, "text": "Drug addict? You're a pie pusher."}, {"start": 937.8, "end": 940.18, "text": "You push pies to get love."}, {"start": 940.18, "end": 941.72, "text": "Give it, Pierce. Stop it."}, {"start": 941.72, "end": 944.1, "text": "It feels fun."}, {"start": 944.1, "end": 947.98, "text": "I'm sorry. I just had a weird déjà vu."}, {"start": 947.98, "end": 949.56, "text": "You're bad at gift-giving."}, {"start": 949.56, "end": 951.98, "text": "That thing you said about worrying about me?"}, {"start": 951.98, "end": 953.72, "text": "Something my dad always said."}, {"start": 953.72, "end": 955.78, "text": "I demand to be house-warmed."}, {"start": 955.78, "end": 957.74, "text": "I shouldn't have brought it up."}, {"start": 957.74, "end": 959.94, "text": "It just reminded me of my dad."}, {"start": 959.94, "end": 960.74, "text": "Anyway."}, {"start": 960.74, "end": 964.02, "text": "A little make out 101, less dad talk,"}, {"start": 964.02, "end": 966.62, "text": "and you could ease up on the bubble gum lip gloss."}, {"start": 966.62, "end": 967.52, "text": "OK."}, {"start": 967.52, "end": 968.42, "text": "I really--"}, {"start": 968.42, "end": 969.32, "text": "No, you--"}, {"start": 973.26, "end": 974.18, "text": "Pizza time."}, {"start": 974.18, "end": 976.66, "text": "Give me this, you godless hippie skank."}, {"start": 976.66, "end": 980.46, "text": "You're a sick, sad, twisted old man, and I hope you die alone."}, {"start": 980.46, "end": 981.36, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 984.86, "end": 986.86, "text": "I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 991.86, "end": 994.86, "text": "I gotta say, I hope this is the real one, because I just found a nickel in the hallway."}, {"start": 999.86, "end": 1003.86, "text": "Ah, okay. Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 1004.86, "end": 1006.86, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 1006.86, "end": 1008.86, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 1013.86, "end": 1015.86, "text": "I don't think you should."}, {"start": 1015.86, "end": 1017.86, "text": "Chaos already dominates enough of our lives."}, {"start": 1017.86, "end": 1020.86, "text": "The universe is an endless, raging sea of randomness."}, {"start": 1020.86, "end": 1022.86, "text": "Our job isn't to fight it, but to weather it together."}, {"start": 1022.86, "end": 1024.86, "text": "On the raft of life."}, {"start": 1024.86, "end": 1028.86, "text": "A raft held together by those few, rare, beautiful things that we know to be predictable."}, {"start": 1028.86, "end": 1030.86, "text": "Ropes? Vines. Vines?"}, {"start": 1030.86, "end": 1032.86, "text": "Let him finish!"}, {"start": 1032.86, "end": 1034.86, "text": "Us."}, {"start": 1034.86, "end": 1038.86, "text": "It won't matter what happens to us as long as we stay honest and accepting of each other's flaws and virtues."}, {"start": 1038.86, "end": 1039.86, "text": "Annie will always be driven."}, {"start": 1039.86, "end": 1040.86, "text": "Shirley will always be giving."}, {"start": 1040.86, "end": 1041.86, "text": "Pierce will never apologize."}, {"start": 1041.86, "end": 1043.86, "text": "Britt is sort of a wild card from my perspective."}, {"start": 1043.86, "end": 1046.86, "text": "And Jeff will forever remain a conniving son of a bitch."}, {"start": 1046.86, "end": 1047.86, "text": "-I'm it."}, {"start": 1047.86, "end": 1049.86, "text": "-There are six sides to this die and seven of us."}, {"start": 1049.86, "end": 1051.86, "text": "He divides the system by which he can never ask you to get the pizza."}, {"start": 1051.86, "end": 1053.86, "text": "-Jeff! -Really?"}, {"start": 1053.86, "end": 1055.86, "text": "-Crafty jackrabbit. -Dag, man."}, {"start": 1055.86, "end": 1056.86, "text": "-Pretty low, dude."}, {"start": 1056.86, "end": 1058.86, "text": "It's called friendship. Look it up."}, {"start": 1058.86, "end": 1060.86, "text": "And car to it."}, {"start": 1060.86, "end": 1062.86, "text": "-I think we just found our pizza getter."}, {"start": 1062.86, "end": 1064.86, "text": "-Yeah. -Yes, we did."}, {"start": 1064.86, "end": 1067.86, "text": "-Oh, like it matters who goes."}, {"start": 1067.86, "end": 1069.86, "text": "[laughter]"}, {"start": 1069.86, "end": 1071.86, "text": "- What's so funny? - Karma."}, {"start": 1073.36, "end": 1076.06, "text": "That guy sucks harder than the toilet and an airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 1076.16, "end": 1078.86, "text": "- Airplane bathroom. - Oh, my pies."}, {"start": 1079.66, "end": 1081.86, "text": "- ♪ Roxanne ♪ - Oh!"}, {"start": 1082.86, "end": 1085.86, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1087.16, "end": 1089.86, "text": "♪ Your days are over ♪"}, {"start": 1090.36, "end": 1093.36, "text": "♪ You don't have to sell your money to the night ♪"}, {"start": 1093.46, "end": 1094.36, "text": "♪ Sing, girls ♪"}, {"start": 1094.46, "end": 1095.66, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪"}, {"start": 1095.76, "end": 1097.16, "text": "I really love your place."}, {"start": 1097.26, "end": 1098.16, "text": "You should move here."}, {"start": 1098.26, "end": 1103.26, "text": "♪ You don't have to wear that dress tonight ♪"}, {"start": 1103.3, "end": 1105.26, "text": "♪ Walk the streets for money ♪"}, {"start": 1105.26, "end": 1107.54, "text": "- Come on, George! ♪ You don't care if it's wrong ♪"}, {"start": 1107.54, "end": 1109.34, "text": "♪ Or if it's right ♪ ♪ If it's right ♪"}, {"start": 1109.34, "end": 1112.66, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪ ♪ Roxanne ♪"}, {"start": 1112.66, "end": 1116.34, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1116.34, "end": 1119.86, "text": "- You gotta see what happens when I leave you alone, huh?"}, {"start": 1119.86, "end": 1123.6, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1123.6, "end": 1127.1, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪ ♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1127.1, "end": 1129.1, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1129.1, "end": 1130.1, "text": "Don't try!"}, {"start": 1130.1, "end": 1133.1, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1133.1, "end": 1134.1, "text": "♪ You are so ♪"}, {"start": 1134.1, "end": 1136.1, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1139.1, "end": 1140.1, "text": "To Pierce."}, {"start": 1140.1, "end": 1142.1, "text": "May he rest in Pierce."}, {"start": 1142.1, "end": 1144.1, "text": "[ Laughs ]"}, {"start": 1144.1, "end": 1146.1, "text": "Shirley, don't you think you've had enough?"}, {"start": 1146.1, "end": 1147.1, "text": "Of you?"}, {"start": 1147.1, "end": 1148.1, "text": "[ Gasps ]"}, {"start": 1148.1, "end": 1150.1, "text": "Guys, I've been thinking about that night over and over."}, {"start": 1150.1, "end": 1151.1, "text": "One thing has become clear."}, {"start": 1151.1, "end": 1153.1, "text": "This is the darkest, most terrible timeline."}, {"start": 1153.1, "end": 1156.1, "text": "Enough with the timeline crap, Abed!"}, {"start": 1156.1, "end": 1158.5, "text": "Pierce got shot in the leg and died."}, {"start": 1158.5, "end": 1161.2, "text": "Shirley's a drunk, and he's locked in a mental ward"}, {"start": 1161.2, "end": 1163.5, "text": "because her guilt drove her insane."}, {"start": 1163.5, "end": 1165.64, "text": "Jeff lost an arm in the fire."}, {"start": 1165.64, "end": 1169.08, "text": "Troy lost his larynx because for some dumb reason,"}, {"start": 1169.08, "end": 1172.28, "text": "he tried to destroy a flaming troll doll by eating it."}, {"start": 1172.28, "end": 1174.08, "text": "Clearly, you don't understand anything"}, {"start": 1174.08, "end": 1175.28, "text": "about defeating trolls."}, {"start": 1175.28, "end": 1178.32, "text": "Life has gone to hell, Abed!"}, {"start": 1178.32, "end": 1179.76, "text": "This is real!"}, {"start": 1179.76, "end": 1181.26, "text": "Look at us! Look at me!"}, {"start": 1181.26, "end": 1184.56, "text": "Britta, you put one washed-away blue streak in your hair,"}, {"start": 1184.56, "end": 1186.56, "text": "and I lost an arm."}, {"start": 1186.56, "end": 1188.56, "text": "Exactly. Life got dark."}, {"start": 1188.56, "end": 1190.56, "text": "All because Jeff rolled a one."}, {"start": 1190.56, "end": 1192.56, "text": "I love how this is my fault somehow."}, {"start": 1192.56, "end": 1194.56, "text": "It's mine. I've run through that night over and over in my head,"}, {"start": 1194.56, "end": 1196.56, "text": "and I keep coming back to one thought."}, {"start": 1196.56, "end": 1198.56, "text": "I should have caught the die and not let you roll it."}, {"start": 1198.56, "end": 1200.56, "text": "I failed to do that and we all suffered for it."}, {"start": 1200.56, "end": 1202.56, "text": "But I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 1204.56, "end": 1205.56, "text": "What is this?"}, {"start": 1205.56, "end": 1207.56, "text": "Of all the timelines, this is clearly the darkest,"}, {"start": 1207.56, "end": 1209.56, "text": "which is why I propose we commit to being evil."}, {"start": 1209.56, "end": 1211.56, "text": "I've made us all black goatees out of felt."}, {"start": 1211.56, "end": 1213.56, "text": "I suggest you put 'em on until you're able to grow your own."}, {"start": 1214.56, "end": 1216.56, "text": "From now on, I'm Evil Abed."}, {"start": 1216.56, "end": 1219.56, "text": "We are the Evil Study Group, and we have but one evil goal."}, {"start": 1219.56, "end": 1221.56, "text": "Return somehow to the prime timeline,"}, {"start": 1221.56, "end": 1223.56, "text": "the one that I stopped you from rolling that die,"}, {"start": 1223.56, "end": 1226.56, "text": "then we destroy the good versions of ourselves and reclaim our proper lives."}, {"start": 1227.56, "end": 1232.56, "text": "Evil Abed, as Evil Jeff, am I allowed to pull fewer punches with you?"}, {"start": 1232.56, "end": 1233.56, "text": "Certainly."}, {"start": 1233.56, "end": 1234.56, "text": "I hate you!"}, {"start": 1234.56, "end": 1236.56, "text": "Shut up with your sci-fi crap!"}, {"start": 1236.56, "end": 1240.56, "text": "I lost my damn arm, and you're making fake beards!"}, {"start": 1240.56, "end": 1241.56, "text": "Go tease."}, {"start": 1244.56, "end": 1246.56, "text": "[footsteps]"}, {"start": 1248.26, "end": 1250.26, "text": "[suspenseful music]"}, {"start": 1253.26, "end": 1255.26, "text": "Evil Troy and Evil Abed!"}, {"start": 1256.26, "end": 1257.26, "text": "[claps]"}, {"start": 1257.26, "end": 1259.26, "text": "[roar]"}, {"start": 1261.26, "end": 1263.26, "text": "[muffled voices]"}, {"start": 1263.26, "end": 1265.26, "text": "What's wrong?"}, {"start": 1265.26, "end": 1267.26, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 1271.26, "end": 1273.26, "text": "I guess nothing."}, {"start": 1274.56, "end": 1281.68, "text": "[MUSIC]"}]}